*> PURPOSE : FEE EXEMPTIONS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : M.S.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1992-01-11 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   1998-12-08 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 165
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB FEENIGHT STEP010
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FEE0037.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 IN-RECORD.
    COPY FEE0037C.
01 RESULT-AREA.
    *> FEE WAIVER INDICATOR
    05 WAIVE-IND          PIC X VALUE 'N'.
    *> MONTHLY SERVICE FEE
    05 MONTHLY-FEE        PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAINLINE.
    ACCEPT IN-RECORD
    PERFORM MONTHLY-FEE-CHECK
    DISPLAY "WAIVE-IND=" WAIVE-IND
    DISPLAY "MONTHLY-FEE=" MONTHLY-FEE
    STOP RUN.
MONTHLY-FEE-CHECK.
    *> MONTHLY FEE WAIVER
    IF ACCT-TYP = 'G'
       OR ACCT-TYP = 'P'
       OR MEAN-BAL >= 5000
        MOVE 'Y' TO WAIVE-IND
        MOVE 0 TO MONTHLY-FEE
    ELSE
        MOVE 7.50 TO MONTHLY-FEE
    END-IF.
